    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A farm or group of buildings where Silkworms are bred. The Silkworm when changing into a pupa spins a cocoon made of silken filaments, these are then unwound and used to manufacture silk thread.</skos:scopeNote>
  </rdf:Description>
